{
  "id": "stranger-things-the-rift",
  "title": "Stranger Things",
  "sourceTitle": "Stranger Things",
  "kind": "show",
  "synopsis": "Hawkins. One more rift. The party is older, the stakes are bigger, and the math homework is, somehow, still due Monday.",
  "releaseYear": 2025,
  "addedAt": "2026-04-09T00:00:00Z",
  "genre": "Sci-Fi",
  "tags": [
    "upside-down",
    "party",
    "small-town"
  ],
  "rating": 3,
  "loved": false,
  "nextStoryId": null,
  "startNodeId": "s1",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "The pool drains weirdly. The lifeguard, who is also Steve, notices first. Robin, beside him, is already calling Dustin.",
      "sceneTitle": "Hawkins Pool, Closing Time",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Call the whole party in",
          "consequence": "Strength in numbers.",
          "nextNodeId": "s2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Investigate quietly first",
          "consequence": "Don't spook the town.",
          "nextNodeId": "s2"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "El is two states away at school. The call drops twice. The third time she just says, 'I'm coming.' She is.",
      "sceneTitle": "Eleven, On the Phone",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Wait for her",
          "consequence": "Trust the heavy hitter.",
          "nextNodeId": "s3"
        },
        {
          "text": "Start without her",
          "consequence": "Don't wait.",
          "nextNodeId": "s3"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "The party reassembles around a kitchen table that has, somehow, more spreadsheets than the FBI.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Wheeler Basement",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Plan first",
          "consequence": "Discipline.",
          "nextNodeId": "s4"
        },
        {
          "text": "Move first",
          "consequence": "Adrenaline.",
          "nextNodeId": "s4"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "text": "A transfer student named Vera knows more about the Upside Down than she should. She also runs cross-country.",
      "sceneTitle": "The New Kid",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Recruit Vera",
          "consequence": "Allies.",
          "nextNodeId": "s5"
        },
        {
          "text": "Watch Vera carefully",
          "consequence": "Trust verifies.",
          "nextNodeId": "s5"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "text": "Hopper has a cabin, a beer, and a tired face. He wants to help. He also wants you to be careful.",
      "sceneTitle": "Hopper's House",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Ask for the gun",
          "consequence": "Older solutions.",
          "nextNodeId": "s6"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ask for his old files",
          "consequence": "Newer solutions.",
          "nextNodeId": "s6"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "text": "Max walks now. She is, against her own will, the quietest of the group. She has, you realize, opinions about the rift you have not yet asked for.",
      "sceneTitle": "Max, Recovering",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Make her tactical lead",
          "consequence": "Promote.",
          "nextNodeId": "s7"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let her opt in",
          "consequence": "Respect.",
          "nextNodeId": "s7"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "text": "Will starts feeling it again. He hates feeling it again. He does not, however, hide.",
      "sceneTitle": "Will's Headache",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Use Will's connection",
          "consequence": "Old talent.",
          "nextNodeId": "s8"
        },
        {
          "text": "Protect Will first",
          "consequence": "Family first.",
          "nextNodeId": "s8"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "text": "A 1960s newspaper has a rift story buried in the obituaries section. The pattern, you realize, is generational.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Library Microfiche",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Photograph the article",
          "consequence": "Document.",
          "nextNodeId": "s9"
        },
        {
          "text": "Find the old witnesses",
          "consequence": "Sources.",
          "nextNodeId": "s9"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "text": "Vera admits she's been tracking the rifts since her family lost a brother in 1989. She is, you realize, also a survivor.",
      "sceneTitle": "Vera's Confession",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Make her co-lead",
          "consequence": "Honor it.",
          "nextNodeId": "s10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Make sure she's okay first",
          "consequence": "Care first.",
          "nextNodeId": "s10"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "There are tunnels. There are always tunnels. The town's pipes have been a map for years and nobody noticed.",
      "sceneTitle": "Tunnels Under Town",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Map the tunnels",
          "consequence": "Cartography.",
          "nextNodeId": "s11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Go in tonight",
          "consequence": "Speed.",
          "nextNodeId": "s11"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "text": "They bicker. They are best friends. They are working. The team is, in their own way, held together by them.",
      "sceneTitle": "Steve and Robin's Bicker",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Send them as a pair",
          "consequence": "Don't split.",
          "nextNodeId": "s12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Send them separately",
          "consequence": "Coverage.",
          "nextNodeId": "s12"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "text": "A new monster — smaller, faster, somehow politer about doors. You hate that you noticed the politeness.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Demogorgon's Cousin",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Engage cautiously",
          "consequence": "Test it.",
          "nextNodeId": "s13"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hit it hard",
          "consequence": "Don't give it time.",
          "nextNodeId": "s13"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "text": "Hopper's old files contain the names of researchers still alive. One is, you discover, in Indianapolis. He will, on the phone, say one sentence and hang up.",
      "sceneTitle": "Lab Records",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Drive to Indianapolis",
          "consequence": "Pursue.",
          "nextNodeId": "s14"
        },
        {
          "text": "Send Steve in your stead",
          "consequence": "Triangulate.",
          "nextNodeId": "s14"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "text": "El, in the rain, in a denim jacket. The room exhales. You realize you have, despite the spreadsheets, been waiting for her exactly this long.",
      "sceneTitle": "Eleven Arrives",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Lead with her",
          "consequence": "Use the gift.",
          "nextNodeId": "s15"
        },
        {
          "text": "Center the team, with her",
          "consequence": "Distributed.",
          "nextNodeId": "s15"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "text": "A skirmish at the pool. Nobody dies. Two get hurt. The monster retreats. You understand its pattern.",
      "sceneTitle": "The First Skirmish",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Press the advantage",
          "consequence": "Move.",
          "nextNodeId": "s16"
        },
        {
          "text": "Plan the second",
          "consequence": "Discipline.",
          "nextNodeId": "s16"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "text": "He says, in his apartment, 'You'll have to close it from inside.' He is, you can tell, telling you the truth he has been afraid to tell for thirty years.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Indianapolis Researcher",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Accept the cost",
          "consequence": "Brave.",
          "nextNodeId": "s17"
        },
        {
          "text": "Look for another way",
          "consequence": "Hope.",
          "nextNodeId": "s17"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "text": "Max draws, on a napkin, a plan that involves all of you, no martyr. The plan is, you suspect, the one El has been quietly thinking too.",
      "sceneTitle": "Max's Plan",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Approve Max's plan",
          "consequence": "Trust her.",
          "nextNodeId": "s18"
        },
        {
          "text": "Refine it with the group",
          "consequence": "Together.",
          "nextNodeId": "s18"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "text": "The mall, again. It is, somehow, always the mall. The rift glows above the food court. You realize you have grown up in this building.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Mall, Empty",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Step in",
          "consequence": "Lead.",
          "nextNodeId": "s19"
        },
        {
          "text": "Anchor outside",
          "consequence": "Hold.",
          "nextNodeId": "s19"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "text": "Vera offers to be the inside-person. So does Will. So, in his way, does Steve. You decide who.",
      "sceneTitle": "Vera's Choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Send Vera",
          "consequence": "She's the runner.",
          "nextNodeId": "s20"
        },
        {
          "text": "Send Will",
          "consequence": "He's the connection.",
          "nextNodeId": "s20"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "text": "The rift, with the team's coordinated push, closes for the last time. The fluorescents flicker. The town does not, this time, lose a kid.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Close",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Stand in the empty mall together",
          "consequence": "Be there.",
          "nextNodeId": "s21"
        },
        {
          "text": "Walk out into the parking lot",
          "consequence": "Step into the after.",
          "nextNodeId": "s21"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "text": "Cars, summer, the team. You realize you will all, eventually, leave this town. Tonight, though, you are right where you should be.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Parking Lot",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Throw a party at the Wheelers'",
          "consequence": "Joy.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_party"
        },
        {
          "text": "Just go to Steve's job for ice cream",
          "consequence": "Simple.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_town"
        },
        {
          "text": "Take the third path",
          "consequence": "Some endings reveal themselves last.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_world"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "end_party",
      "text": "You stay close — through college, through breakups, through one wedding and one funeral. The party never breaks up. You realize, late, that the rift was never the point. The friendships were.",
      "sceneTitle": "Party Together",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Party Together"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_town",
      "text": "You stay in Hawkins. You become a person who watches the town for next time. Next time, mercifully, does not come.",
      "sceneTitle": "Hawkins, After",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Hawkins, After"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_world",
      "text": "You leave Hawkins and never quite leave it. Wherever you go, a part of you is in that basement around that table. You take the lesson — that a small group of kids can save a town — into every other room of your life.",
      "sceneTitle": "Out Into the World",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Out Into the World"
    }
  ]
}
